# The Returning Islet (CIPlay the_returning_islet): The Lullaby Frequency's side island, quest "Supper for Four". The
# hut's pad at 2.5 m round 0 0; the stilt hut spans -2.25..2.25 (deck 2.6 m over the pad), its ladder on the south;
# the table at 0 0.45; the hatch at 1.35 -1.35 on the deck, the box under it on the sand. Each plate's note shows the
# next one 20 s after it is read (the design's 600 s, cut short for tests). DEEP 10-25: the Watch Rock at -26 22 (foot zone
# hillfoot at -13.02 11.02), the net shed at 30 -28 (-12 m), the children's cave's zone at 28 25.
island The Returning Islet
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Supper for Four
wait 3
expect shown plate1
expect hidden plate2
expect hidden plate4
expect hidden hatchbox
walk 0 -16 to 0 -6 to 0 -3 h=2.5
use floorhatch
expect message nailed down
read Plate 1
expect step 1
expect hidden plate2
wait 22
expect shown plate2
read Plate 2
expect step 2
wait 22
read Plate 3
expect step 3
wait 22
read Plate 4
expect step 4
use floorhatch
expect message prise
zone hillfoot
expect step 5
zone hilltop
expect step 6
read Fisherman Tobias Grey's note
expect step 7
open Watch hut chest
expect story prybar 1
expect step 8
zone netshed
expect step 9
air netair
read Net mender Hanne Grey's note
expect step 10
zone childcave
read Ned Grey's note
open Den box
expect step 10
walk 0 -16 to 0 -6 to 0 -3 h=2.5
use floorhatch
expect shown hatchbox
expect message tin box
open Floor hatch
expect story crystal 1
expect done
